<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 202-8 AT CLOSE V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 202-8 AT CLOSE V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>AHMEDABAD, India 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 202-8 in reply to India's first innings of 223 at the close on the second day of the first test on Thursday.</p>
</text>
